													"default": false,
													"title": "SPR employer full rate elected (CPF, F/G)",
													"description": "CPF Board Tables 4–5: the employer of an SPR in the first or second year of status may apply to contribute at the full employer rate while the employee stays on the graduated rate; record it on the CPF standing from the month the Board approves. spr_full_rates (both full) takes precedence."
